The land is hot. There is lava and monsters everywhere, and a fortress. A different ecosystem. That is interesting.
We have lived in peace since Midranda's defeat. I thought it would go on...

They have not invaded our world, but we do not know what they are planning. We must be careful. I need more data.

Please, bring some samples of these monsters. Be careful!

[Challenge Objective]

Hunt Igniculus, the Lava Guardian or the Lava Archer and collect 5 Fire Fragments in the Heart of Fire.
When you are done, talk to Sage Celina in Pillai.
